SOAPBOX: Great conditions for this contest Down Under.
SOAPBOX: The excellent Propagation allowed a focus on 6pt Qs to EU and NA when the bands were open.
SOAPBOX: Even FT4 shone as a contest mode, despite the large number of ops not using split on FT4, which caused massive RX congestion and failed decodes on my TX QRG.
SOAPBOX: A good number of contesters were operating, although I found I needed to hunt Mults on standard frequencies.
SOAPBOX: While testing my operation before the contest, I detected several issues with N1MM and operated an earlier version in the contest.
SOAPBOX: Thanks for all the contacts, I had a heap of fun.
